        {
            "post_type": "post",
            "post_title": "How to make a chai latte?",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The word 'chai' comes from the Hindu word for tea. A chai latte is a drink made out of black tea of choice, spice blend, sweetener, and hot milk.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>How to make a chai latte at home?<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To brew the perfect chai latte at home, you'll need:<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>loose-leaf black tea of choice (for example Assam, Ceylon, English Breakfast).<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>spices - cinnamon, cardamom, cloves, peppercorns.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>favorite milk - dairy or plant-based.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>sweetener - honey, maple syrup, or sugar.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Method<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Toast the spices in a small saucepan over medium heat.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add water, and bring to a simmer.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Remove the saucepan from the heat and add the tea leaves. Cover and steep for about 10 minutes.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add the sweetener and stir until dissolved.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Heat up and froth the milk using a milk frother.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pour 3\/4 cup of the warm tea into a cup. Add 1\/2 cup of warmed milk and stir to combine. <\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Top with a spoonful of milk froth.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ol>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->",
            "post_name": "how-to-make-a-chai-latte",
